scn 1
# Six Drakes (Crusades) fight-moved together onto one point. Retail has no fight-move: a flyer's leg flies
# VTOL_Move, whose resolved descriptor carries the group-spread flag (0x5214b0), so each keeps its offset from
# the selection's centre within sqrt(3000 n) px; past stage 0 its air-traffic check (417d4e) steps it out of a
# stack. Through protocol 307's first cut every flyer flew to the click without a mission and piled onto it.
name air-stack-fight
ticks 1500
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
group drakes 0 drake 6 cells 20,70 20,74 20,78 20,82 20,86 20,90
at 2 fight drakes 100 80
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
